# Phase 1A — Schenck Process Belt Weigh Feeder Simulator

## Overview

Simulate a **Schenck Process MULTIDOS Belt Weigh Feeder** controlled by a **DISOCONT Tersus** controller — the most widely deployed gravimetric feeder in cement, mining, and bulk material handling plants.

The simulator models the **core physics** of the DISOCONT measurement loop:

```
Feed Rate (t/h) = Belt Load (kg/m) × Belt Speed (m/s) × 3.6
```

All sensor values are derived from this relationship, making the simulation physically coherent — anomalies in one sensor will correctly cascade into others.

