## MQTT Topic Schema

```
pmp/{plantId}/weigh_feeder/{equipmentId}/telemetry    ← sensor data (every tick)
pmp/{plantId}/weigh_feeder/{equipmentId}/state        ← state change events
pmp/{plantId}/weigh_feeder/{equipmentId}/alerts       ← threshold breach alerts
pmp/{plantId}/weigh_feeder/{equipmentId}/status       ← heartbeat (every 30s)
```

